WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:09.670
Explosive Shoot

00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:19.810
Keep fighting chasing your dream

00:00:19.810 --> 00:00:23.140
with love, courage and friendship

00:00:23.140 --> 00:00:26.640
This Blade and I are one

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:29.680
Spin as hard as you can until the limit

00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:32.780
BURNING SOUL

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:46.200
The things I can't do alone

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:50.140
are not impossible if you're with me

00:00:50.490 --> 00:00:52.960
Come with me

00:00:52.960 --> 00:00:56.280
to the ends of this world

00:00:58.070 --> 00:01:03.540
The Four Sacred Beasts are athletes of love

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:07.100
Shine! Open your eyes!

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:09.730
Dragoon  Dranzer  Draciel  Driger

00:01:09.730 --> 00:01:12.450
Awaken!

00:01:12.790 --> 00:01:16.060
Fly across the sky, my energy

00:01:16.060 --> 00:01:19.380
Rise up, Sacred Beast!

00:01:19.380 --> 00:01:22.830
To defeat all the enemies who stand in our way

00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:26.050
jump, bearing everyone's hopes

00:01:26.070 --> 00:01:29.080
SHINING SOUL

00:01:31.250 --> 00:01:37.000
Oxygen levels, lung capacity, heart rate, muscular tension... everything is perfect.

00:01:37.160 --> 00:01:39.490
Alright, I'm in top form!

00:01:39.490 --> 00:01:42.990
You're surprisingly diligent
when it comes to this stuff.

00:01:43.400 --> 00:01:47.530
Managing one's health is the basis
for any respectable first-class athlete.

00:01:47.530 --> 00:01:51.420
Being prepared to bring out
your full potential in any fight...

00:01:51.690 --> 00:01:54.370
Those unable to do so will always be in second.

00:01:54.370 --> 00:01:58.850
That's precisely why
I chose you to be team captain.

00:01:58.850 --> 00:02:06.280
Our research institute values superhuman physical ability and thorough self-care.

00:02:07.060 --> 00:02:12.640
For this project, we've been using our latest technology and equipment

00:02:12.640 --> 00:02:15.880
in order to bring out your full potential.

00:02:16.880 --> 00:02:21.630
Your Trygle's stats are
top-notch as well.  Everything is ready.

00:02:21.630 --> 00:02:23.800
Yeah, I can't complain.

00:02:23.800 --> 00:02:30.040
Of course not! Director Judy made an exception for you and lead the maintenance team herself!

00:02:30.040 --> 00:02:34.270
Emily, that's enough.
Tell Micheal of our battle plan.

00:02:34.270 --> 00:02:35.330
Right away.

00:02:36.240 --> 00:02:41.020
Your opponent is Max—the member of BBA that we've gathered the most data on.

00:02:41.020 --> 00:02:45.040
His Bey, Draciel, is undoubtedly suited to defense.

00:02:45.400 --> 00:02:49.970
However, it has but a fifth of your Cannon Ball's power.

00:02:49.970 --> 00:02:52.770
No matter what you do, it should be an easy win.

00:02:53.410 --> 00:02:56.510
What on Earth? So I can win, even when holding back?

00:02:56.510 --> 00:03:00.690
We only need this mission to go according to plan.

00:03:00.690 --> 00:03:03.820
Tch! I don't like such easy wins.

00:03:03.820 --> 00:03:09.170
There will come a time that makes use of your full power, so you'll just have to be patient.

00:03:09.600 --> 00:03:13.910
The Beyblades I created with years of research,

00:03:13.910 --> 00:03:16.160
first-class Bladers,

00:03:16.160 --> 00:03:20.690
and even a flawless strategy devised from the data on our opponents!

00:03:21.220 --> 00:03:26.680
Max, I'll show you the highest point of Beyblade to be devised.

00:03:26.680 --> 00:03:31.680
The Conclusion of The American Tournament!!

00:03:31.680 --> 00:03:34.960
This is no good! We can't win like this!

00:03:35.020 --> 00:03:38.320
What's up, Professor? What are you going on about?

00:03:38.750 --> 00:03:43.480
I've been analyzing this next
match, but it's looking hopeless!

00:03:43.480 --> 00:03:45.180
No matter how it adds up...

00:03:45.180 --> 00:03:47.680
Huh..? What do you mean?

00:03:48.110 --> 00:03:51.900
Basically... It's difficult to admit, but...

00:03:51.900 --> 00:03:52.940
in this next match...

00:03:54.590 --> 00:03:56.680
Max has no hope of winning!

00:03:56.680 --> 00:04:00.370
Think about it! The opponent's coach is Max's mother!

00:04:00.370 --> 00:04:03.150
She obviously knows everything about Max!

00:04:03.150 --> 00:04:05.410
More importantly, that includes his weakness!

00:04:05.410 --> 00:04:10.050
And don't get me started on how
their Beyblades and Bladers are all first-class!

00:04:10.050 --> 00:04:12.550
Ha! So what?

00:04:12.550 --> 00:04:14.980
As if what's written on
a computer means anything!

00:04:14.980 --> 00:04:19.110
That's my point! They have massive supercomputers at their disposal!

00:04:19.110 --> 00:04:22.520
Me, on the other hand... I'm stuck with this cheap homemade laptop...

00:04:22.520 --> 00:04:25.030
No matter how you put it,
we can't compete with that...

00:04:25.030 --> 00:04:27.040
<i>No problem</i>, Professor.

00:04:27.240 --> 00:04:28.940
I'm totally fine.

00:04:28.940 --> 00:04:31.530
Even if your analysis proves to be right...

00:04:31.920 --> 00:04:33.520
I'll give it my all!

00:04:34.170 --> 00:04:36.250
Well then...

00:04:36.250 --> 00:04:41.600
Let me introduce the special stadium for the World Tournament's A-Block...!

00:04:42.980 --> 00:04:49.440
How incredible! The Bey Stadium for the World Tournament's A-Block is well-suited to America!

00:04:49.440 --> 00:04:53.820
It's a baseball stadium, dedicated to our country's King of Sports!

00:04:53.820 --> 00:04:58.440
Now, who will be victorious in the last battle?

00:04:58.440 --> 00:05:00.360
A baseball stadium?!

00:05:05.080 --> 00:05:07.510
I just have to give it everything I've got!

00:05:08.050 --> 00:05:09.800
Contestants, get in position!

00:05:10.200 --> 00:05:12.840
Now, let's get the first battle on the road!

00:05:15.060 --> 00:05:20.580
I will give you a taste of my overwhelming power—a kind that you can't beat by simply giving your all!

00:05:20.920 --> 00:05:23.590
Three, Two, One!

00:05:23.590 --> 00:05:26.040
Go... Shoot!

00:05:26.040 --> 00:05:28.340
Draciel, <i>go!</i>

00:05:28.340 --> 00:05:31.790
Try and resist Trygle's power!

00:05:31.890 --> 00:05:34.680
Cannon Ball Attack!

00:05:38.100 --> 00:05:43.110
Wow! Right off the bat, Max's Draciel shoots past first base!

00:05:43.110 --> 00:05:46.900
He goes around second base...
And now he's passed third!

00:05:46.900 --> 00:05:49.810
Still, this is a Beyblade match!

00:05:49.810 --> 00:05:53.360
Scoring a home run
won't count as a win around here!

00:05:53.360 --> 00:05:58.080
Is this some kind of way
of showing off Draciel's power?

00:05:58.790 --> 00:06:04.030
Oh! Micheal's Cannon Ball is targeting Draciel like a pitcher's return toss!

00:06:04.030 --> 00:06:06.380
It's a cross play at the home plate!

00:06:06.380 --> 00:06:07.500
What?!

00:06:25.350 --> 00:06:28.160
Draciel touches out!

00:06:28.760 --> 00:06:31.100
The fight was determined in an instant!

00:06:31.100 --> 00:06:35.550
Our first battle ends with Micheal's overwhelming victory!

00:06:36.200 --> 00:06:39.180
S-So strong! He was <i>perfect</i>...

00:06:39.180 --> 00:06:43.320
Is it as the Professor said? Do I truly have no chance at winning?

00:06:43.640 --> 00:06:48.730
Now do you understand, Max?
This is power, created to rule the world.

00:06:49.010 --> 00:06:53.710
Against the PPB's elite sporting group, born from a union of science and sports,

00:06:53.710 --> 00:06:56.020
you will never, ever win.

00:06:57.300 --> 00:07:01.040
I knew it was hopeless!
Their Cannon Ball is way too strong!

00:07:01.040 --> 00:07:05.780
There's no way we can win this! Like I said earlier, according to my calculations, Max has no—

00:07:05.780 --> 00:07:07.890
Shut up, shut up, shut up!

00:07:08.100 --> 00:07:10.480
Hey, Max! Open your ears!

00:07:11.740 --> 00:07:16.260
You're a huge idiot!
Not only that, you're a bird-brain!

00:07:16.640 --> 00:07:17.340
<i>What?</i>

00:07:18.390 --> 00:07:20.760
Why are you calling me an idiot all of a sudden?!

00:07:20.760 --> 00:07:23.760
I'm calling you an idiot
'cause that's what you are!

00:07:23.760 --> 00:07:27.760
I'm telling you, act like the usual Max!

00:07:28.550 --> 00:07:29.760
Takao...

00:07:29.760 --> 00:07:34.680
You told your mother that you would win this battle! Did you forget?!

00:07:34.680 --> 00:07:38.060
You huge idiot..! Do whatever you want!

00:07:41.430 --> 00:07:44.720
Takao! How could you
say something so awful?!

00:07:44.720 --> 00:07:47.010
Max is our teammate!

00:07:47.010 --> 00:07:51.420
Plus, you're the team captain! Couldn't you be a little kinder to him?

00:07:51.420 --> 00:07:53.890
As if I could be kind after what he's done!

00:07:53.890 --> 00:07:55.370
I agree with you there.

00:07:55.370 --> 00:08:00.550
Max is a first-class Blader.
And as a first-class, we must consider his pride.

00:08:00.550 --> 00:08:03.640
Pampering him now
would be counterproductive.

00:08:03.640 --> 00:08:05.840
What are you saying, Kai?!

00:08:06.480 --> 00:08:07.840
Don't be so brash.

00:08:07.840 --> 00:08:12.550
We'll see whether this had a positive
or negative influence in the next match.

00:08:15.470 --> 00:08:22.550
"Do what you want", huh? I'm really sorry for you. Your captain sucks at giving orders.

00:08:22.550 --> 00:08:24.900
Don't speak rudely of my friends.

00:08:25.480 --> 00:08:27.810
Also, that wasn't an order!

00:08:27.810 --> 00:08:29.320
Then what was it?

00:08:29.320 --> 00:08:33.330
The BBA team now has their backs against the wall.

00:08:33.510 --> 00:08:38.240
Will they be shut down by the PPB's fierce power?

00:08:39.790 --> 00:08:44.690
Takao's words... He was cheering for me!

00:08:45.350 --> 00:08:47.170
<i>Are you ready?</i>

00:08:47.170 --> 00:08:49.510
Let's move onto the second set!

00:08:49.830 --> 00:08:52.510
Threee, Two, One!

00:08:52.510 --> 00:08:54.520
Go... Shoot!

00:08:54.520 --> 00:08:57.210
Cannon Ball Attack!

00:09:01.790 --> 00:09:04.250
Go, Draciel!

00:09:07.310 --> 00:09:08.880
T-This is..!

00:09:08.880 --> 00:09:09.840
What's wrong?

00:09:09.840 --> 00:09:14.430
Max's skill level has suddenly increased!

00:09:14.430 --> 00:09:15.320
What?!

00:09:24.680 --> 00:09:26.120
W-What?!

00:09:26.120 --> 00:09:32.010
Oh?! This time around, Draciel endures without being knocked back!

00:09:32.010 --> 00:09:34.510
Did Trygle's power go down?

00:09:34.510 --> 00:09:38.600
I-Impossible! I didn't
make any mistakes in pitching!

00:09:38.600 --> 00:09:41.380
How can it be?! How can he withstand it?!

00:09:43.960 --> 00:09:47.720
Keep it up, Draciel!

00:09:49.940 --> 00:09:51.670
I-Impossible!

00:10:00.660 --> 00:10:08.080
It's over! Max turned the battle's tides against Micheal, an opponent evidently stronger than himself!

00:10:08.080 --> 00:10:10.270
Awesome! Max, you did great!

00:10:10.270 --> 00:10:11.200
He did it!

00:10:11.200 --> 00:10:14.520
Wow! But where did that power come from?

00:10:15.800 --> 00:10:21.620
The spirit to face opponents that are stronger than you awakens a dormant power within...

00:10:22.800 --> 00:10:25.230
You're starting to look like Kinomiya.

00:10:25.860 --> 00:10:30.120
Max, this is it! Keep it up!

00:10:30.360 --> 00:10:33.680
Emily, hurry to correct our
simulation with this new data!

00:10:33.930 --> 00:10:36.200
Please give me a moment. I'll have it prepared.

00:10:38.000 --> 00:10:39.940
It's as I thought..!

00:10:39.940 --> 00:10:44.830
During the second match, Max's power was at least five times higher than the Cannon Ball's!

00:10:47.600 --> 00:10:50.370
It appears that he'll have to use his right.

00:10:50.480 --> 00:10:51.880
H-His right?!

00:10:51.880 --> 00:10:57.240
Please! His right is our secret weapon! Weren't we were going to save it for the final selection?

00:10:57.240 --> 00:10:59.130
You really want to use it here?!

00:10:59.460 --> 00:11:01.420
The data was thrown off!

00:11:01.420 --> 00:11:04.890
Our job is to respond to it accordingly.

00:11:07.230 --> 00:11:08.270
Micheal!

00:11:09.600 --> 00:11:11.200
Use your right.

00:11:15.610 --> 00:11:19.900
All out, huh, Director? You want me to use my right here?

00:11:19.900 --> 00:11:21.280
Are you against it?

00:11:35.530 --> 00:11:38.760
What's with him? He dropped his glove!

00:11:39.660 --> 00:11:44.810
Of course not.
Showing off is what I do. It's my pleasure.

00:11:45.920 --> 00:11:52.110
I was planning to save it for a later match, but I'll make an exception and show it to you.

00:11:52.110 --> 00:11:54.520
You should be thankful!

00:11:59.240 --> 00:12:05.530
Oh? What is going on? Micheal has moved the shooter to his left hand!

00:12:05.800 --> 00:12:08.280
I knew it. He was right-handed.

00:12:08.280 --> 00:12:09.780
What?!

00:12:09.780 --> 00:12:14.780
So up until now, he was shooting
with his non-dominant arm?!

00:12:14.780 --> 00:12:17.750
He was already so strong,
and he wasn't even going all-out?!

00:12:22.750 --> 00:12:26.980
To overcome even the smallest
chance of losing and triumph...

00:12:26.980 --> 00:12:29.070
This is what it means to win.

00:12:29.070 --> 00:12:34.290
Dang it! Don't lose now, Max! Show them your guts!

00:12:34.290 --> 00:12:36.720
Such random cheering won't help him!

00:12:36.720 --> 00:12:41.240
What are you saying?! This is the time you most need guts and hard work!

00:12:41.240 --> 00:12:42.930
He's got a point.

00:12:42.930 --> 00:12:46.330
If you don't put your heart into it, you
will lose the fight before it even begins.

00:12:46.840 --> 00:12:49.680
Get it together! I know you can do this!

00:12:50.720 --> 00:12:57.120
Thank you, Rei. An earlier me would've already given up on any hope of winning.

00:12:57.440 --> 00:13:05.410
But now I've changed. You're filling me with power! Takao, Rei, Kai! You've never given up!

00:13:05.410 --> 00:13:10.850
When I look at you, I feel
like I can't give up either!

00:13:11.650 --> 00:13:17.990
The PPB, who's gotten here making use of data and technology,

00:13:17.990 --> 00:13:24.000
and the BBA, who has overcome every obstacle with pure friendship and determination.

00:13:24.000 --> 00:13:27.880
Who will be the champions of the World Tournament's A-Block?

00:13:27.880 --> 00:13:30.870
Everything will be decided with a single match!

00:13:30.870 --> 00:13:34.000
The final battle is on!

00:13:45.800 --> 00:13:47.280
Hey, Micheal.

00:13:48.550 --> 00:13:49.470
Thanks.

00:13:53.110 --> 00:13:56.610
The final battle is about to start!

00:13:57.020 --> 00:13:58.360
Ready?

00:13:58.360 --> 00:14:01.320
Three, Two, One!

00:14:01.320 --> 00:14:05.320
Play Ball— No, wait. Go... Shoot!

00:14:05.320 --> 00:14:09.460
This is the pitch thrown with
every ounce of my power!

00:14:09.460 --> 00:14:14.580
Take it! Cannon Ball Maximum Attack!

00:14:15.730 --> 00:14:16.550
Go!

00:14:17.610 --> 00:14:18.950
You're finished!

00:14:36.490 --> 00:14:40.140
What amazing power! It's on a whole newlevel!

00:14:40.140 --> 00:14:41.890
I knew it was hopeless!

00:14:41.890 --> 00:14:44.730
No, it's not over yet.

00:14:44.730 --> 00:14:45.280
Look!

00:14:45.280 --> 00:14:50.040
Oh? Draciel has somehow managed to resist!

00:14:56.040 --> 00:15:02.270
This has gotta hurt! Trygle's relentless attack is cornering Draciel!

00:15:05.460 --> 00:15:07.820
What will Max-kun do now?

00:15:07.820 --> 00:15:08.640
Indeed.

00:15:08.640 --> 00:15:10.970
Ah! Max!

00:15:10.970 --> 00:15:13.490
This is no good! No good whatsoever!

00:15:13.490 --> 00:15:18.100
What are you doing, Professor?! Stop calculating Max's probability of defeat!

00:15:18.100 --> 00:15:24.730
That's not what I'm doing! I'm trying to search for something that'll give Max an advantage!

00:15:25.540 --> 00:15:30.240
Even the smallest thing would do! Isn't there anything we can use..?

00:15:30.240 --> 00:15:31.610
There is a way.

00:15:31.740 --> 00:15:33.250
For real, Kai?

00:15:33.250 --> 00:15:37.160
But Max needs to discover
that on his own, or it'll all be for nothing.

00:15:39.610 --> 00:15:42.640
Tsk! You always talk like you know everything.

00:15:42.640 --> 00:15:45.170
I bet there isn't a chance.

00:15:45.170 --> 00:15:45.750
No.

00:15:45.750 --> 00:15:48.200
There <i>is</i> a way to win! I'm sure of it!

00:15:48.560 --> 00:15:53.220
I <i>will</i> believe! I don't know
why, but I feel like I'm obligated to!

00:15:54.600 --> 00:15:55.820
Max...

00:15:56.500 --> 00:16:00.640
By now, you should be very
familiar with what I'm talking about...

00:16:01.130 --> 00:16:05.610
The way to summon Draciel's true power...

00:16:06.410 --> 00:16:09.480
Trygle's attack hasn't let up!

00:16:09.480 --> 00:16:13.350
But Draciel is just barely holding on!

00:16:14.390 --> 00:16:16.960
Give it up, Max.

00:16:16.960 --> 00:16:21.500
No matter how long you keep struggling, you won't win. That's the cold, hard truth.

00:16:24.400 --> 00:16:26.400
I think it's time to take you down.

00:16:27.390 --> 00:16:32.810
Micheal, you're a really amazing Blader. I can see why my Mama chose you.

00:16:32.810 --> 00:16:33.960
I don't know if I can beat you as I am now, but I will not give up.

00:16:33.960 --> 00:16:36.430
Max, don't give up!

00:16:36.430 --> 00:16:37.430
Max!

00:16:37.430 --> 00:16:37.730
I don't know if I can beat you as I am now, but I will not give up.

00:16:37.730 --> 00:16:41.920
I have my friends, cheering
on me with all they have.

00:16:41.920 --> 00:16:44.240
And I have Genbu.

00:16:44.800 --> 00:16:48.400
I'll fight you... with everything I've got!

00:16:48.990 --> 00:16:53.490
Mama, take a look! This is my power! This is my way of fighting!

00:16:54.900 --> 00:16:55.870
What?

00:16:55.870 --> 00:16:57.870
Go, Draciel!

00:17:02.680 --> 00:17:06.300
What?! Are you telling me
you still intend on fighting?!

00:17:06.300 --> 00:17:09.080
You should already be way past your limit!

00:17:09.080 --> 00:17:11.170
Why? How?!

00:17:23.360 --> 00:17:25.320
I've yet to give up!

00:17:30.820 --> 00:17:32.380
W-What?!

00:17:38.250 --> 00:17:40.080
What? What's going on?!

00:17:40.080 --> 00:17:42.000
Draciel's stats are..!

00:17:44.380 --> 00:17:46.050
Of course! I get it now!

00:17:47.790 --> 00:17:53.750
While the PPB came at us with
first-class technology and amazing athletes,

00:17:55.940 --> 00:18:00.640
they also rely on nothing but pure scientific data.

00:18:01.070 --> 00:18:06.180
Max, on the other hand, has bet
everything on his own potential!

00:18:06.180 --> 00:18:11.400
Power that comes straight from the heart explodes in an unscientific fashion!

00:18:11.800 --> 00:18:17.570
The PPB turned a blind eye to the invisible power which comes from the heart!

00:18:17.570 --> 00:18:21.080
I will believe in our hearts!

00:18:22.800 --> 00:18:25.280
And in my own heart!

00:18:37.350 --> 00:18:39.640
No way! How could this..?

00:18:40.270 --> 00:18:44.190
What a fight..! What a comeback!

00:18:44.190 --> 00:18:49.240
Still spinning after
taking down its opponent is Max's Draciel!

00:18:49.640 --> 00:18:56.050
Even after being pushed into the corner time and time again, Max finally won.

00:18:56.600 --> 00:19:02.780
And with that, the BBA
wins the World Tournament's A-Block!

00:19:03.780 --> 00:19:05.930
I lost? How..?

00:19:07.730 --> 00:19:09.470
I can't believe it.

00:19:09.680 --> 00:19:11.720
How could we lose?

00:19:11.720 --> 00:19:14.060
You really did it, Max!

00:19:14.060 --> 00:19:17.160
You were amazing! You did it, Max!

00:19:22.020 --> 00:19:23.190
I see...

00:19:23.820 --> 00:19:25.190
Now I understand.

00:19:27.830 --> 00:19:30.640
You're really amazing, Max!

00:19:38.110 --> 00:19:41.600
Congratulations on winning
the World Tournament's A-Block.

00:19:41.600 --> 00:19:46.120
It was a splendid battle, especially the final technique you used. It was a <i>miracle.</i>

00:19:46.120 --> 00:19:50.160
Thank you, Mama. But that wasn't really a technique or whatever.

00:19:50.160 --> 00:19:52.120
It kind of came naturally.

00:19:52.640 --> 00:19:54.400
So you were improvising?

00:19:55.440 --> 00:19:57.840
That must be why our data wasn't of any use.

00:20:00.050 --> 00:20:01.390
Max...

00:20:01.390 --> 00:20:03.110
What is is, Mama?

00:20:04.090 --> 00:20:06.220
I will return to Japan soon.

00:20:08.720 --> 00:20:10.850
I'll be waiting!

00:20:10.850 --> 00:20:14.080
Man, you're really unpredictable.

00:20:14.080 --> 00:20:17.180
It's impossible to tell whether you're strong or weak.

00:20:17.180 --> 00:20:19.320
We'll accept our defeat for now.

00:20:19.320 --> 00:20:20.580
Yeah, <i>this</i> time.

00:20:22.020 --> 00:20:23.520
Don't you dare lose now!

00:20:23.520 --> 00:20:27.610
Even after winning and moving out of the A-Block, you still won't smile?

00:20:28.020 --> 00:20:32.920
Of course not. Even stronger Bladers are sure to be at the final selection.

00:20:32.920 --> 00:20:35.040
I can't be happy with just this.

00:20:35.780 --> 00:20:38.820
You're still as stiff as ever, Kai-kun.

00:20:38.820 --> 00:20:41.840
Are you going to tell them they shouldn't celebrate?

00:20:42.860 --> 00:20:44.990
I'm not their guardian.

00:20:44.990 --> 00:20:48.640
And either way, I'm sure
they're already aware of all that.

00:20:51.850 --> 00:20:52.720
What's so funny?!

00:20:52.720 --> 00:20:55.000
Oh, nothing. Nothing at all.

00:20:56.030 --> 00:20:57.950
Care to explain what happened?

00:20:58.750 --> 00:21:01.660
Our data analysis was flawless.

00:21:01.660 --> 00:21:03.690
But you still went and lost, didn't you?

00:21:03.690 --> 00:21:08.180
That's wasn't an error in our analysis. We had omitted a certain factor.

00:21:08.180 --> 00:21:10.700
Then you should quickly proceed to research it.

00:21:11.900 --> 00:21:15.420
I don't think it's something
you can conduct research on...

00:21:16.390 --> 00:21:21.230
Rather, they will discover on their own in the coming battles.

00:21:21.230 --> 00:21:25.170
And I plan to support them with all that I have.

00:21:25.760 --> 00:21:31.440
Alright! Let's keep it up and go crazy in the World Tournament's Final Block!

00:21:31.440 --> 00:21:32.690
Yeah!

00:21:39.960 --> 00:21:44.720
Spring waves its hand smiling,

00:21:44.720 --> 00:21:50.200
Summer spreads passion.

00:21:50.200 --> 00:21:55.350
Seasons pass one after the other,

00:21:55.350 --> 00:21:59.560
Fall and Winter are good friends.

00:22:01.000 --> 00:22:05.660
When there is a problem you can't solve,

00:22:05.660 --> 00:22:11.560
Trust, friendship, love and emotion

00:22:14.120 --> 00:22:18.800
Clouds keep flying across the sky,

00:22:18.800 --> 00:22:24.200
the sky keeps changing every second

00:22:24.200 --> 00:22:29.090
My eyes well up and tears stream down my face,

00:22:29.090 --> 00:22:33.090
but they're not tears of sadness

00:22:34.820 --> 00:22:39.420
I summon my courage and try to put it into words.

00:22:39.420 --> 00:22:44.770
"Let's go on a journey to the city of hope!"

00:22:44.770 --> 00:22:49.760
All your dreams will come true

00:22:57.280 --> 00:23:00.350
According to my analysis, it's a miracle!

00:23:00.350 --> 00:23:03.940
We've finally got our hands on a ticket to the final tournament!

00:23:03.940 --> 00:23:06.420
I'm about to faint from sheer happiness!

00:23:06.420 --> 00:23:10.690
It's is also a good opportunity
for us to reflect on the BBA's past battles.

00:23:10.690 --> 00:23:15.350
But hidden among them
is a shocking truth! Ellipsis...

00:23:15.350 --> 00:23:18.940
Next time: BBA - Miracle of the Fierce Battles!

00:23:18.940 --> 00:23:24.220
Stuff like this, stuff like that,
all kinds of stuff! I'm stuffed!
